{"id":"5232bfe264029cd2","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-lem-reflection.md","title":"Reflection Lemma","display":"lem-reflection — Reflection Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-reflection","aliases":["58-lem-reflection"],"display":"lem-reflection — Reflection Lemma","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md]]","[[../batch13/58-thm-reflection.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-reflection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-reflection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-reflection — Reflection Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"aabdf3005231e9dc\" href=\"?note=aabdf3005231e9dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md\">../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dea0e944a5a296c9\" href=\"?note=dea0e944a5a296c9\" title=\"../batch13/58-thm-reflection.md\">../batch13/58-thm-reflection.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar a\">\\(\\bar a\\)</span> is a finite tuple of sets matching the free variables of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\in V\">\\(\\gamma\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (notion from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\beta\">\\(V_\\beta\\)</span> (cumulative-hierarchy level from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> is the metatheoretic satisfaction relation, applicable to the proper-class structure <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(V,\\in)\">\\((V,\\in)\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}reflection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\n\\to\n\\exists\\beta\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\n\\land\\gamma\\in\\beta\n\\land\\bar a\\in V_\\beta^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\land\n\\left(\n(V_\\beta,\\in\\cap(V_\\beta\\times V_\\beta))\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[\\bar a]\n\\leftrightarrow\n(V,\\in)\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[\\bar a]\n\\right)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}reflection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\n\\to\n\\exists\\beta\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\n\\land\\gamma\\in\\beta\n\\land\\bar a\\in V_\\beta^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\land\n\\left(\n(V_\\beta,\\in\\cap(V_\\beta\\times V_\\beta))\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[\\bar a]\n\\leftrightarrow\n(V,\\in)\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[\\bar a]\n\\right)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>For any formula and finite parameter tuple, there is a rank containing the parameters at which that formula reflects.</li>\n<li>The occurrence of satisfaction for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> is explicitly metatheoretic; the displayed relation on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\beta\">\\(V_\\beta\\)</span> is its restricted membership relation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md","status":"resolved","id":"aabdf3005231e9dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-thm-reflection.md","status":"resolved","id":"dea0e944a5a296c9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-thm-reflection.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar a","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"V_\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"(V,\\in)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}reflection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\n\\to\n\\exists\\beta\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\n\\land\\gamma\\in\\beta\n\\land\\bar a\\in V_\\beta^{<\\omega}\n\\land\n\\left(\n(V_\\beta,\\in\\cap(V_\\beta\\times V_\\beta))\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[\\bar a]\n\\leftrightarrow\n(V,\\in)\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[\\bar a]\n\\right)\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"V_\\beta","display":false}],"bytes":1446,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3918","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-lem-reflection.md|58-lem-reflection]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["aabdf3005231e9dc","dea0e944a5a296c9","65418b505fc53093","5582a281f15a33c2","8b6a90316aad78a4"]}